                "text": "Toured the Children's Center in Allentown to see the incredible work being done in early education, housing, and maternal health. Going back to my time as a Pennsylvania State Representative, I've been passionate about improving maternal health and supporting working families. I'll keep working with great organizations like this one to fight for parents and children throughout the Greater Lehigh Valley.",
