                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On this National Women's Health Week, we bring awareness to the health challenges impacting women. In the Pennsylvania State House, I was proud to author legislation that created our state's Maternal Mortality Review Committee. In Congress, I'm co-leading the Preventing Maternal Deaths Reauthorization Act of 2025, which enhances funding, strengthens review committees, and supports the dissemination of best practices. I'll keep working to support the fight for women's health.",
                "text_lang": "en",
