                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Honoring the men and women who have sacrificed their health and their lives in service to our communities. This year, the names of 19 officers from Pennsylvania \u2014 including two who lost their lives in the past year \u2014 will be engraved alongside the names of over 24,000 fallen officers on the National Law Enforcement Officers Memorial in Washington, DC. \n\nThank you:\n\nPHILIP J MICHAEL Pennsylvania State Constable\nTHOMAS M HORLACHER Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nCHARLES S CONNER Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOSEPH ROBERT BURNS Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nWILLIAM F WOOD Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nMARTIN JOSEPH O'BRIEN Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nTHOMAS D TROTT Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nWALTER S DANLEY Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOHN JOSEPH BURNS Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nMARTIN R CLARK Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOSEPH M DOWNS Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOHN D ALMENRADER Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOHN A GAGHAN Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOHN P FREIERMUTH Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOHN DIAMOND Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nWALTER S BATES Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nROBERT J RITCHIE Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJOHN P REID Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.\nJAIME J ROMAN Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, P.D.",
