                "text": "The proliferation of smartphones among children is creating unnecessary distractions for children in American schools \u2014 contributing to worsening academic performance and mental health. At today\u2019s hearing on this issue, I had the opportunity to ask about how parents can play a role in reducing the amount of time that children spend on personal devices in the classroom.",
