                "text": "Great to join Chairman Walberg for a tour of Cencora\u2019s distribution center in Bethlehem. As a key hub for distributing pharmaceuticals and medical supplies, this site plays an important role in supporting patient care across the region and beyond. Proud to see innovation and logistics in the Greater Lehigh Valley delivering critical medications reliably, fueling local jobs, and advancing health outcomes around the world.",
