                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Recently talked with @ASP about the return of the Presidential Fitness Test and what it represents. Our nation\u2019s ongoing challenges with childhood obesity are impacting everything from mental health to military readiness, and we owe it to America\u2019s youth to do better. See the conversation: https://t.co/vczNL4IO96",
