                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As part of the Working Families Tax Cuts, we are making an unprecedented $50 billion in rural health care. Starting in 2026, Pennsylvania will be receiving its first distribution of funding \u2014 $193 million to support a range of critical initiatives. By investing in our health care workforce, embracing innovation, improving substance abuse treatment, and supporting providers, we can deliver better outcomes for rural communities throughout the Lehigh Valley and the Poconos.\n\nLearn more: https://t.co/GMcJYlB7Sz",
